  "details": "I never set a custom status and it could be a cool feature to be able to link Spotify to show what song your currently listening in your status. For example when you open your menu, on people nameplates it could show what they’re listening to where their status usually is. It would also mean that less people will have massive, disruptive chunks of text in their chatboxes with what their listening to. Since VrChat seems to be overhauling the customisation of profiles this could be a cool feature.",
